  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_028) outperforms pca_n2000 in multimodal setups, but fusion method impact remains unclear. This experiment tests weighted fusion (vs. concat in config_028) with scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image, isolating the effect of fusion strategy. It directly compares two multimodal configurations differing only in fusion type, providing critical insight into whether weighted fusion improves performance, while building on the established superiority of scvi_n200."
